  "consentBodyV1": "In debates you write down your position and your arguments. These texts can reveal your political opinions, which are a special category of personal data under the GDPR (Art. 9).\n\nWith your explicit consent, Dicrates processes these texts only to run your debates: an AI service in the EU creates anonymous summaries for your room, a compromise proposal and your points. Other players never see your own texts, your email address or your name.\n\nYou can withdraw your consent and delete your account and your texts at any time.",
